{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank You for Your Application</strong> is a narrative-driven interview simulation game. You play as a fresh graduate who has the rare chance to join the largest company in Aeropolis as an interviewer. You\u2019ll screen resumes and issue thank letters for various reasons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fiercely competitive job market \u2014 not only are workers from other regions constantly pouring in, but countless robots are also taking up positions.  After interviewing candidates for various positions, you will gradually uncover the truth about the company\u2026 and the city itself.  <br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/df016ae427effa2d6fae0297802cc69e.avif?t=1772190859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras_big/df016ae427effa2d6fae0297802cc69e.avif?t=1772190859 width=800 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple story branches and endings: your choices shape the story\u2019s direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interviewees from diverse backgrounds: will you side with capital or stand with the workers?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of online shopping after work: earn in Aeropolis, spend in Aeropolis \u2014 you won\u2019t take a single cent home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life management as a corporate drone: pay bills, browse forums, and keep your mind stable</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/c1a0ec99dded771c2b2f3f0f6a6b0372.avif?t=1772190859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras_big/c1a0ec99dded771c2b2f3f0f6a6b0372.avif?t=1772190859 width=800 height=77 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Review candidates\u2019 resumes and documents based on the company\u2019s daily hiring requirements, and decide whether to hire or reject them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check their <strong>internship certificates</strong>, we want experienced graduates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check their <strong>emotion evaluation reports</strong>, we want mentally stable employees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check their <strong>graduation certificate</strong>, we want students from top universities, but we can't use their education as a reason to reject them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/50b982dbce52af413f1b41f41c0c18e6.poster.avif?t=1772190859\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/50b982dbce52af413f1b41f41c0c18e6.webm?t=1772190859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/50b982dbce52af413f1b41f41c0c18e6.mp4?t=1772190859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/d51da46aacf347bc3ac6e27b4019c724.avif?t=1772190859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras_big/d51da46aacf347bc3ac6e27b4019c724.avif?t=1772190859 width=800 height=77 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to pay the rent on time to avoid becoming an illegal resident without a place to live.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to maintain your own mental health; the company doesn\u2019t want employees on the verge of a breakdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/52b50ff5e8c72462d0e81a6f1d454a5d.poster.avif?t=1772190859\" width=800 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/52b50ff5e8c72462d0e81a6f1d454a5d.webm?t=1772190859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/52b50ff5e8c72462d0e81a6f1d454a5d.mp4?t=1772190859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When hiring turns into pretend hiring, when pretend hiring turns into layoffs, and when the layoffs spill over into themselves, where do the workers go from here?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/58b5b8107a925eb18728d7a0854b7b1e.poster.avif?t=1772190859\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/58b5b8107a925eb18728d7a0854b7b1e.webm?t=1772190859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/58b5b8107a925eb18728d7a0854b7b1e.mp4?t=1772190859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2881370?t=1772190859","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/caa6278feeb42bc883e5a732f640eaaf84b60edc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772190859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/c87b94f8a4a4a5d1b039ead014006b72da8a6ab3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772190859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/c87b94f8a4a4a5d1b039ead014006b72da8a6ab3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772190859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3640210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Play the brand new demo as part of Steam's Next Fest!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/f310f8ae91c41502d672dbdb862afef4.avif?t=1772190859\" width=1170 height=274 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank You for Your Application</strong> is a narrative-driven interview simulation game. You play as a fresh graduate who has the rare chance to join the largest company in Aeropolis as an interviewer. You\u2019ll screen resumes and issue thank letters for various reasons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fiercely competitive job market \u2014 not only are workers from other regions constantly pouring in, but countless robots are also taking up positions.  After interviewing candidates for various positions, you will gradually uncover the truth about the company\u2026 and the city itself.  <br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/df016ae427effa2d6fae0297802cc69e.avif?t=1772190859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras_big/df016ae427effa2d6fae0297802cc69e.avif?t=1772190859 width=800 height=77 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple story branches and endings: your choices shape the story\u2019s direction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interviewees from diverse backgrounds: will you side with capital or stand with the workers?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of online shopping after work: earn in Aeropolis, spend in Aeropolis \u2014 you won\u2019t take a single cent home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life management as a corporate drone: pay bills, browse forums, and keep your mind stable</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/c1a0ec99dded771c2b2f3f0f6a6b0372.avif?t=1772190859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras_big/c1a0ec99dded771c2b2f3f0f6a6b0372.avif?t=1772190859 width=800 height=77 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Review candidates\u2019 resumes and documents based on the company\u2019s daily hiring requirements, and decide whether to hire or reject them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check their <strong>internship certificates</strong>, we want experienced graduates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check their <strong>emotion evaluation reports</strong>, we want mentally stable employees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check their <strong>graduation certificate</strong>, we want students from top universities, but we can't use their education as a reason to reject them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/50b982dbce52af413f1b41f41c0c18e6.poster.avif?t=1772190859\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/50b982dbce52af413f1b41f41c0c18e6.webm?t=1772190859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/50b982dbce52af413f1b41f41c0c18e6.mp4?t=1772190859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/d51da46aacf347bc3ac6e27b4019c724.avif?t=1772190859\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras_big/d51da46aacf347bc3ac6e27b4019c724.avif?t=1772190859 width=800 height=77 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to pay the rent on time to avoid becoming an illegal resident without a place to live.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember to maintain your own mental health; the company doesn\u2019t want employees on the verge of a breakdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/52b50ff5e8c72462d0e81a6f1d454a5d.poster.avif?t=1772190859\" width=800 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2881370/extras/52b50ff5e8c72462d0e81a6f1d454a5d.webm?t=1772190859\" type=\"video/